    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Pungent yellow powder of the seeds of any of several common mustard plants, used as a condiment, dye, or in medicine as a stimulant and diuretic, an emetic, or a counterirritant. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
